content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Designer",
      "description": "Person creating clothing concepts and related materials."
    },
    {
      "name": "Clothing Concept",
      "description": "Initial design idea for a potential garment."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sample Production",
      "description": "Small production run of a concept using selected fabrics."
    },
    {
      "name": "Fabric",
      "description": "Material chosen for producing sample pieces."
    },
    {
      "name": "Collection",
      "description": "Set of finalized pieces prepared for a season or release."
    },
    {
      "name": "Piece",
      "description": "Individual garment derived from a clothing concept."
    },
    {
      "name": "Campaign Outline",
      "description": "Initial structure of the marketing campaign for a collection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Production Manager",
      "description": "Person estimating and approving production-related work."
    },
    {
      "name": "Effort Estimate",
      "description": "Assessment of materials and work needed for a concept."
    },
    {
      "name": "Marketing Manager",
      "description": "Person planning and coordinating marketing activities."
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Product Media",
      "description": "Images or media files used for promotional content."
    },
    {
      "name": "Retail Buyer",
      "description": "Person selecting and ordering pieces for retail stores."
    },
    {
      "name": "Retail Order",
      "description": "Order placed by a retail buyer for specific pieces with delivery dates."
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Date",
      "description": "Confirmed date for delivering ordered pieces."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Input from the retail buyer regarding the pieces or collection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Manufacturing Officer",
      "description": "Person coordinating production and handling manufacturing requests."
    },
    {
      "name": "Production Order",
      "description": "Instruction to manufacture items in a collection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Manufacturer",
      "description": "Entity responsible for producing physical garments."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Marketing": {
      "objects": [
        "Marketing Manager",
        "Campaign Outline",
        "Final Product Media"
      ]
    },
    "Manufacturing": {
      "objects": [
        "Manufacturing Officer",
        "Production Order",
        "Manufacturer"
      ]
    },
    "Distribution": {
      "objects": [
        "Retail Buyer",
        "Collection",
        "Retail Order",
        "Piece",
        "Delivery Date",
        "Feedback"
      ]
    },
    "Collection Design": {
      "objects": [
        "Designer",
        "Production Manager",
        "Clothing Concept",
        "Sample Production",
        "Effort Estimate",
        "Collection",
        "Piece"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Marketing": {
      "derived from": "Marketing Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Marketing Manager",
        "Campaign Outline",
        "Final Product Media"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Manufacturing": {
      "derived from": "Manufacturing Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Manufacturing Officer",
        "Production Order",
        "Manufacturer"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Distribution": {
      "derived from": "Distribution Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Retail Buyer",
        "Catalogue",
        "Retail Order",
        "Piece Selection",
        "Delivery Date",
        "Feedback"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Collection -> Catalogue",
        "Piece -> Piece Selection"
      ]
    },
    "Collection Design": {
      "derived from": "Collection Design Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Designer",
        "Production Manager",
        "Clothing Concept",
        "Sample Production",
        "Effort Estimate",
        "Collection",
        "Piece"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
